# Module-Only File Placement (mandatory)

## Rule

**Never create module migration, extraction, or refactor tooling under `scripts/` or repo root.**

Every file belongs in:

| What | Where |
|------|--------|
| Application logic | `Modules/{Name}/app/Application/` |
| Domain | `Modules/{Name}/app/Domain/` |
| Infrastructure (migration helpers, repos) | `Modules/{Name}/app/Infrastructure/` |
| Controllers, Artisan commands | `Modules/{Name}/app/Presentation/` |
| Module docs | `Modules/{Name}/docs/` or `Modules/{Name}/README.md` |
| Module tests | `Modules/{Name}/tests/` |
| Cross-app audit only | `app/Console/Commands/` + `app/Infrastructure/Migration/` |

## Allowed in `scripts/`

Ops only: deployment, DB diagnostics, local dev setup, maintenance — **not** Extract/Wrap/Delegate tooling.

## Artisan pattern

```bash
php artisan clinics:wrap-legacy-web-controllers
php artisan inventory:wrap-legacy-controllers
php artisan migration:find-unwrapped-controllers   # app-wide audit only
```

## Examples

```
❌ scripts/wrap-clinic-controllers.php
✅ Modules/Clinics/app/Infrastructure/Migration/WrapLegacyV1ClinicControllers.php
✅ Modules/Clinics/app/Presentation/Console/Commands/WrapLegacyV1ClinicControllersCommand.php

❌ docs/architecture/clinics-migration-plan.md
✅ Modules/Clinics/docs/MIGRATION_PLAN.md
```
